  message: "Fixed in PR #2354 (dev 39bef1108): the four forms no longer hash a parameter name.\nFILED REPROS RE-RUN on dev 39bef1108 (the item's own residual_fixtures a/ and b/, which differ only in the parameter names): TS g (object-type method signature), h (call signature) and I.m (interface method member), Go F (interface-literal method): stable ids DIFFERENT between a and b on dev 05ed6f5fe, SAME on 39bef1108. Form 4, type predicates, run through the whole pipeline (the item had checked the normalizer only): p(f: (x: unknown) => x is string) against (y: unknown) => y is string: DIFFERENT on dev 05ed6f5fe, SAME on 39bef1108 (the predicate names its subject by position, #0 is T).\nMEASURED by the builder: knex 290, hocuspocus 27, nest packages 215 ids moved; Go 0 on caddy and alertmanager (no interface literal with a named parameter there).\nNOT FIXED, filed: TS x?: T and x: T hash alike, as do ...xs: T[] and xs: T[]: WI-siror-bupaz-zofiz-jomam-jimim-komoh-vavad-sirar.\nEvidence: ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/v19_11232026/closure/ (out_dev.txt = dev 39bef1108 after the merge, out_base.txt = dev 05ed6f5fe before it; repro trees t/, run.sh, q.py, presplit.py)."  # eee5
